   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formal or informal",
     "texto": [
      "With an adult you don't know, you use **Sehr geehrte Frau Schmidt,** (Dear Mrs Schmidt). With friends, **Liebe Anna,** (Dear Anna).",
      "To sign off formally: **Mit freundlichen Grüßen** (yours sincerely). With friends: **Viele Grüße** (best wishes)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking politely",
     "texto": [
      "**Könnten Sie mir bitte helfen?** (could you help me, please?). **Ich würde mich freuen** (I would be pleased). These are the polite forms you already know from lesson 38.",
      "**Vielen Dank für Ihre Nachricht** (thank you very much for your message). **Ich freue mich auf Ihre Antwort** (I look forward to your reply)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
